(7489524, 1192490, 33392, '<td valign="top">To shoot at a high-enough speed to freeze the motion of her foot, this must be a very high iso.  Almost no noise, so my complements to the camera or the post-processing (or both).</td>', 'To shoot at a high-enough speed to freeze the motion of her foot, this must be a very high iso.  Almost no noise, so my complements to the camera or the post-processing (or both).', '2016-12-30 07:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
