(7489533, 1192521, 33392, '<td valign="top">I would be very tempted to try a crop that eliminated the artificial lights at the bottom.  Lovely sky colors.</td>', 'I would be very tempted to try a crop that eliminated the artificial lights at the bottom.  Lovely sky colors.', '2016-12-30 07:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489534, 1192488, 33392, '<td valign="top">This is one of those difficult shots where to get good light levels on the candle, you end up under-exposing everything else.  Or, as is your approach, blowing out the candle (pardon the pun) to adequately light everything else.  Might have worked better if you used a low-level background fill to better illuminate the trees so you could bring down the exposure a bit on the candle.</td>', 'This is one of those difficult shots where to get good light levels on the candle, you end up under-exposing everything else.  Or, as is your approach, blowing out the candle (pardon the pun) to adequately light everything else.  Might have worked better if you used a low-level background fill to better illuminate the trees so you could bring down the exposure a bit on the candle.', '2016-12-30 07:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7489535, 1192512, 33392, '<td valign="top">Not one of of my favorites in this challenge.  dark and uninspiring.  Sorry.</td>', 'Not one of of my favorites in this challenge.  dark and uninspiring.  Sorry.', '2016-12-30 07:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
