(7490436, 1192506, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>That is some view you have from your study, Im not very envious am I! Calmness and brightness are what your image is all about so in terms of the challenge brief you have fulfilled it well. At first I thought I wish we could see a little more of the detail of the opposite shore but on reflection I prefer it as it is, there is just a hint of interesting detail on both shores, enough to add but not enough to detract. The suns rays are what gives the image its impact, I think there is room for a little more contrast to really make it stand out.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge That is some view you have from your study, Im not very envious am I! Calmness and brightness are what your image is all about so in terms of the challenge brief you have fulfilled it well. At first I thought I wish we could see a little more of the detail of the opposite shore but on reflection I prefer it as it is, there is just a hint of interesting detail on both shores, enough to add but not enough to detract. The suns rays are what gives the image its impact, I think there is room for a little more contrast to really make it stand out.', '2017-01-04 06:13:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7490437, 1192190, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Congratulations Oli, a very well deserved high score and your first of many future ribbons. What a wonderfully serene image this is, it fulfils the calmness aspect of challenge brief fully. Those gorgeous tree shapes against the foggy background on a golden carpet of grass is just sublime. I love the contrast between the sharply defined foreground tree shapes against those gradually receding into the mist. Your composition is good with the most dominant tree on the left vertical third. Thanks for sharing this gorgeous image with us Oli.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Congratulations Oli, a very well deserved high score and your first of many future ribbons. What a wonderfully serene image this is, it fulfils the calmness aspect of challenge brief fully. Those gorgeous tree shapes against the foggy background on a golden carpet of grass is just sublime. I love the contrast between the sharply defined foreground tree shapes against those gradually receding into the mist. Your composition is good with the most dominant tree on the left vertical third. Thanks for sharing this gorgeous image with us Oli.', '2017-01-04 06:20:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7490440, 1192502, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon. This was one of my three 10s. It is really lovely - and meets both criteria of the challenge superbly.</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon. This was one of my three 10s. It is really lovely - and meets both criteria of the challenge superbly.', '2017-01-04 07:09:35.000000', NULL, 0),
