(7490548, 1192190, 97905, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by docjonny:</b></div><hr/><i> Top 3 for sure.. voted already.. lovely misty dreamy view.. Interested to know where and what time of the day.. Good luck .. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>thanks mate!<br/>it was in the late afternoon and the light was by FAR less attractive than this looks - it was dim, getting dark, quite miserable in the rain around freezing temperatures.</td>', 'Originally posted by docjonny: Top 3 for sure.. voted already.. lovely misty dreamy view.. Interested to know where and what time of the day.. Good luck ..   thanks mate!it was in the late afternoon and the light was by FAR less attractive than this looks - it was dim, getting dark, quite miserable in the rain around freezing temperatures.', '2017-01-05 07:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7490635, 1192478, 109227, '<td valign="top">Great job Jeff, this was one of my favs of the challenge, simple and unique.</td>', 'Great job Jeff, this was one of my favs of the challenge, simple and unique.', '2017-01-05 22:40:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7490637, 1192169, 109227, '<td valign="top">Congrats Karen; this is beautiful.</td>', 'Congrats Karen; this is beautiful.', '2017-01-05 22:40:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7490694, 1192478, 37858, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the kind comments.  Most of the effort that went into this photo was to make the geometry of the shapes interesting and balanced and to get the light and shadows working together with this odd little tree.<br/> <br/>I bought this tree for Christmas because it reminded me of the little wreck of a tree that Charlie Brown had in his Christmas TV special so long ago.  As odd as it is, I liked it better than the traditional tree that was also set up in my home (go figure).  So I get the "odd duck" comment about this photo.  To me, the photo is all about the shapes, lighting, and the oddity of the tree.</td>', 'Thanks for all the kind comments.  Most of the effort that went into this photo was to make the geometry of the shapes interesting and balanced and to get the light and shadows working together with this odd little tree. I bought this tree for Christmas because it reminded me of the little wreck of a tree that Charlie Brown had in his Christmas TV special so long ago.  As odd as it is, I liked it better than the traditional tree that was also set up in my home (go figure).  So I get the "odd duck" comment about this photo.  To me, the photo is all about the shapes, lighting, and the oddity of the tree.', '2017-01-06 04:02:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(7491461, 1192478, 112739, '<td valign="top">Jeff- the unusual and barren setting for this very unique tree creates feelings of sadness and also hopefulness. The lights help create that hopeful feeling but the door creates an exit the viewer may wish to take. Congrats on creating a very strong compositional and dynamic image.</td>', 'Jeff- the unusual and barren setting for this very unique tree creates feelings of sadness and also hopefulness. The lights help create that hopeful feeling but the door creates an exit the viewer may wish to take. Congrats on creating a very strong compositional and dynamic image.', '2017-01-09 22:22:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7496086, 1192466, 186268, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2017-02-01 09:51:29.000000', NULL, 0);
